nd wanted to see what's on tuesday, if you can pull that up for me.\", \"I need to sort out rides for later, so for the glassblowing one, do you know who else is going to be there with me?\", \"I feel like it's been ages since I caught up with her, so when was the last time we actually spoke to each other?\", \"Oh, and something just came to mind, I've lost track of the Elodie business, so when is that actually happening again?\", \"I think I got a bit carried away tidying up earlier and binned the wicker photo by accident, so could you put it back for me please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0030\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you add the Nyvoe picture to the, uh, the Winter 2024 album please\", \"oh wait no, that's the wrong photo, I meant the… the window one\"], [\"Nyvoe picture into Winter 2024 album\", \"wrong pic — the window one\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0031\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please tell me what the actual password is for the raku club?\", \"Thank you. Also, would you mind adding Shethie to the glassblowing share group?\"], [\"ok so what's the… what's the actual password for the raku club again?\", \"oh and umm, can you add Shethie to the, uh, glassblowing share group?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0032\", \"v\": [[\"umm how much did I, like, spend last week altogether?\", \"ok and what about… recently?\", \"oh and can you, um, stick the Nyvoe photo in the Winter 2024 album?\"], [\"what did my spending come to last week\", \"and recently?\", \"also pls put the Nyvoe photo in the Winter 2024 album thx\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0034\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you pull up my… what events have I got on anvil in my calendar?\"], [\"I keep losing track of what's where across my calendars, so could you just show me the events I've got on anvil? That's the one I need right now.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0035\", \"v\": [[\"We're thinking about redoing a few rooms and I jotted a bunch of ideas down a while back, so what have I written in the Jevkimere house notebook?\"], [\"Jevkimere house notebook contents?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0037\", \"v\": [[\"when's glassblowing?\", \"call off the broom\", \"no, wrong one — the Hideo one\", \"expenses over thirty five dollars?\"], [\"I've got a lot on this month and completely forgot to write it down, so when is my glassblowing thing happening again?\", \"Something's come up and I can't make it anymore, so could you go ahead and call off the broom for me?\", \"Oh no, hang on, that was the wrong event you cancelled, the one I actually meant was the Hideo one, sorry about that.\", \"Switching gears, I'm trying to keep a closer eye on my budget, so which of my expenses came to more than thirty five dollars?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0038\", \"v\": [[\"umm what have I got that's, like, glassblowing related?\"], [\"glassblowing stuff?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0039\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to figure out if I can squeeze in a trip later this week, so what have I got on four days from now?\"], [\"whats on for me four days from now\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0040\", \"v\": [[\"We've been splitting a lot of supplies lately and I've lost track of who owes what, so where does Morwenna Guo stand with me in the glassblowing share group?\"], [\"Could you please tell me what Morwenna Guo's balance with me is in the glassblowing share group?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0042\", \"v\": [[\"umm when's my, uh, my Arjun thing again?\", \"oh different thing, is there a… do I have anything in the calendar at Zymaness Meadows?\"], [\"I know I've got something coming up with Arjun but I can't for the life of me remember when, so when is my Arjun thing?\", \"Separate question, a friend mentioned a spot I might've booked something at, so is there a calendar event at Zymaness Meadows at all?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0043\", \"v\": [[\"what Arjun stuff do i have\", \"contact details for the second one pls\", \"hang on how much did the night cost\", \"wait quick one which group is the whisk deposit expense in\", \"how many is that\"], [\"Arjun stuff?\", \"second one's contact info\", \"hang on — night cost?\", \"wait, whisk deposit — which group?\", \"how many's that?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0044\", \"v\": [[\"I paid thirteen dollars for bike hire. Could you please put it in primrose kitty?\", \"Thank you. Also, would you please make a note to self: the plumber prefers texts.\"], [\"paid thirteen dollars for bike hire, put it in primrose kitty pls\", \"oh and note to self the plumber prefers texts\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0045\", \"v\": [[\"documents mentioning broom?\", \"star the second\"], [\"umm which documents have, like, broom in them?\", \"ok can you star the… the second one?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0046\", \"v\": [[\"can u show me the pics from the Mompox trip\"], [\"Mompox trip photos\"]]}","ttft_ms":5710,"type":"result","duration_ms":22559,"uuid":"1a442d02-940f-4a56-aaa5-fcf14ee47b3b","ttft_stream_ms":1487,"time_to_request_ms":175,"first_content_frame_ms":1488,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22370521,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278921050.9768,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
